ge/upload/t_thumb/sckbe2.jpg"}, {"id": 947889, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sckbe9.jpg"}, {"id": 947874, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sckbdu.jpg"}, {"id": 947876, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sckbdw.jpg"}, {"id": 947878, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sckbdy.jpg"}, {"id": 947880, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sckbe0.jpg"}, {"id": 947883, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sckbe3.jpg"}, {"id": 947884, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sckbe4.jpg"}, {"id": 947885, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sckbe5.jpg"}, {"id": 947886, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sckbe6.jpg"}, {"id": 947887, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sckbe7.jpg"}], "slug": "zwei-the-arges-adventure", "storyline": "Pokkle and Pipiro are two step-siblings living by themselves in the ho-hum village of Puck on the time-forgotten floating continent of Arges. Pokkle loves making terrible puns and wears a tail for funsies, and Pipiro loves buying fashionable clothes and has no filter whatsoever. Together, they meander through what seems to be a peaceful, monotonous existence in their sleepy little burg where nothing interesting ever happens.\n\nUntil something does, anyway! A mysterious masked figure shows up one night and steals six holy idols from the local shrine. The self-proclaimed \u201cArchduke of Arges\u201d tenders a hefty reward for their return, and our \u201cbrave\u201d duo jumps at the chance to go find them \u2013 Pokkle for the glory, and Pipiro strictly for the cash moneys.", "summary": "Boasting a completely standalone story set on a mysterious \u201clow fantasy\u201d island floating amongst the clouds, Zwei: The Arges Adventure plays out as a classically styled action-oriented 2D dungeon crawler with oodles of optional content and unlockables, player-defined challenge through a unique food-based experience system, and a pervading tongue-in-cheek humor style that helps set it apart from other entries in the genre.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/zwei-the-arges-adventure", "videos": [{"id": 80888, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "zHWLLOQnv6k", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zHWLLOQnv6k", "title": "PSP\u7248\u300cZwei!!\u300d \u30c7\u30e2\u30e0\u30fc\u30d3\u30fc", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zHWLLOQnv6k/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 80890, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "3n9LgXhfqrE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3n9LgXhfqrE", "title": "Zwei: The Arges Adventure - Launch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3n9LgXhfqrE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 175412, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "Gz-HCnQQybc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Gz-HCnQQybc", "title": "Zwei: The Arges Adventure - Launch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Gz-HCnQQybc/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 2772, "name": "Zwei"}]}